        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='18550' id='28' type-v2='text' w='87407' x='1328' y='83369'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'>- Key Issue:</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> 26.5%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> customer churn rate which puts monthly revenue of</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'> $139,131</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> at risk</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'>- High Risk Areas:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> 1) Month-to-month contracts have </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>43%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> churn - Smaller commitment hence easier exit</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> 2) First year customers - </run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000'>47%</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> churn within the first 12 months</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> 3) Customers with month-to-month subscription and electronic check payment option - Highest Risk Group</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000'> 4) Customers that do not have services like tech support, online security, etc in their bundle offer are more likely to churn</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
